{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;We've had this conversation before, haven't we?&quot; says the shadow on the doorway.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped within a spiral, Laura must carve her way through the depths of her unconscious mind or sink into the void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301370/extras/45bc3be4c73e2477a7a9e7f4941e7dab.poster.avif?t=1772746338\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301370/extras/45bc3be4c73e2477a7a9e7f4941e7dab.webm?t=1772746338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301370/extras/45bc3be4c73e2477a7a9e7f4941e7dab.mp4?t=1772746338\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Retro Survival Horror\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find supplies and survive as you navigate a deserted town with monsters that will haunt you around every corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301370/extras/db14e4e497793fe8fcb5cf2dd35fb258.poster.avif?t=1772746338\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301370/extras/db14e4e497793fe8fcb5cf2dd35fb258.webm?t=1772746338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301370/extras/db14e4e497793fe8fcb5cf2dd35fb258.mp4?t=1772746338\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Psychological Nightmare</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The environment will change with every loop, becoming more corrupted as you unearth previous buried trauma.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301370/extras/c3dff7b95d9431734dc94f907d4862f3.poster.avif?t=1772746338\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301370/extras/c3dff7b95d9431734dc94f907d4862f3.webm?t=1772746338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301370/extras/c3dff7b95d9431734dc94f907d4862f3.mp4?t=1772746338\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight your way out</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipped with various weapons, Laura is not utterly hopeless against her pursuers. Fight through the nightmare and earn your life back, or die trying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301370/extras/5f9ddd21d500a65bb97900754c6ae322.poster.avif?t=1772746338\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301370/extras/5f9ddd21d500a65bb97900754c6ae322.webm?t=1772746338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301370/extras/5f9ddd21d500a65bb97900754c6ae322.mp4?t=1772746338\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solve puzzles and uncover the truth.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some truths hide in plain sight; others require key pieces of your memories to unlock. Solve these puzzles to unlock new areas and peel back the curtain of painful memories you forgot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3301370?t=1772746338","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301370/09d38094e5c583c5007ae25fe5e5ca61694ffb2d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772746338","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301370/8adb93ac35f0fdcff67f9b104fa66780e9928d92/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772746338","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301370/8adb93ac35f0fdcff67f9b104fa66780e9928d92/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772746338","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Comatose deals with sensitive themes such as domestic violence, sexual abuse, childhood trauma, and loss. The adult content is not explicit visually, but is present throughout the narrative and may be disturbing to some players."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4297010,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;We've had this conversation before, haven't we?&quot; says the shadow on the doorway.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped within a spiral, Laura must carve her way through the depths of her unconscious mind or sink into the void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301370/extras/45bc3be4c73e2477a7a9e7f4941e7dab.poster.avif?t=1772746338\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301370/extras/45bc3be4c73e2477a7a9e7f4941e7dab.webm?t=1772746338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301370/extras/45bc3be4c73e2477a7a9e7f4941e7dab.mp4?t=1772746338\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Retro Survival Horror\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find supplies and survive as you navigate a deserted town with monsters that will haunt you around every corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301370/extras/db14e4e497793fe8fcb5cf2dd35fb258.poster.avif?t=1772746338\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301370/extras/db14e4e497793fe8fcb5cf2dd35fb258.webm?t=1772746338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301370/extras/db14e4e497793fe8fcb5cf2dd35fb258.mp4?t=1772746338\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Psychological Nightmare</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The environment will change with every loop, becoming more corrupted as you unearth previous buried trauma.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301370/extras/c3dff7b95d9431734dc94f907d4862f3.poster.avif?t=1772746338\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301370/extras/c3dff7b95d9431734dc94f907d4862f3.webm?t=1772746338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301370/extras/c3dff7b95d9431734dc94f907d4862f3.mp4?t=1772746338\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight your way out</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipped with various weapons, Laura is not utterly hopeless against her pursuers. Fight through the nightmare and earn your life back, or die trying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301370/extras/5f9ddd21d500a65bb97900754c6ae322.poster.avif?t=1772746338\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301370/extras/5f9ddd21d500a65bb97900754c6ae322.webm?t=1772746338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301370/extras/5f9ddd21d500a65bb97900754c6ae322.mp4?t=1772746338\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solve puzzles and uncover the truth.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some truths hide in plain sight; others require key pieces of your memories to unlock. Solve these puzzles to unlock new areas and peel back the curtain of painful memories you forgot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Lucky Dart"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301370/8ddfc4f8e809c307d2faa7f70abe0d0137f5d687/header.jpg?t=1772746338","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3301370/761046549/89f0bc59246ca6427a6e866f7e7d821cd8e37e8d/1769263133/dash_av1.mpd?t=1769263551","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3301370/761046549/89f0bc59246ca6427a6e866f7e7d821cd8e37e8d/1769263133/dash_h264.mpd?t=1769263551","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3301370/761046549/89f0bc59246ca6427a6e866f7e7d821cd8e37e8d/1769263133/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1769263551","id":257272002,"name":"Comatose Demo Traile